WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
I watched 20 Antifa militants help my assault suspect

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.380
escape into an Antifa safe house

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:09.840
that is one block away from the ICE facility.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.680
It's where they're arresting, they're showering,

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:15.480
they're eating to continue this occupation.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.620
I have staked out this safe house

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.000
and have observed shift changes.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.639
This group is highly organized.

00:00:21.639 --> 00:00:24.200
It is being funded through mutual aid groups,

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.540
and they have no plans of stopping.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:27.980
The press is under attack,

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:30.440
and the White House press couldn't care less.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.939
They're complaining about Trump waking them up on Air Force One

00:00:33.939 --> 00:00:36.660
while brave reporters are documenting the dangers

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.419
of domestic terrorism in blue cities.

00:00:39.419 --> 00:00:42.299
My question for all of you is, how would you feel?

